		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ivory scales and four horns frame the snout of this 70- foot-long wind dragon. Fickle, capricious, erratic.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 storm breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Storm Breath</strong>. A double near- size cube of obscuring fog and shocking electricity extending from dragon. CON 15+ or 2d8 damage. Lasts 1d4 rounds, damage each round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stormblood</strong>. Lightning immune and unaffected by fog, mist, or vapors.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
